    "saturation_note": "**Saturation.** nvidia-smi utilisation was 93% with one worker and 99-100% with 2-8 workers; without MPS the aggregate rate fell to 0.86x (2 workers) and 0.80x (8 workers) of one worker's, because the processes time-slice the device. With CUDA MPS it rose to 1.23x at 4 workers and 1.26x at 8, so the card is saturated at about 4 workers. Utilisation did not stay low, so the data do not support moving to several cheaper cards to gain throughput; running one pod with MPS and about 4 workers is the efficient setting on this card.",
